mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course teaches the material civilization, political civilization, spiritual civilization and ecological civilization of medieval Europe. The main contents include the ecology, climate and agricultural technology; commerce, cities and urban citizen class; feudalism, vassalage and chivalry; royal power, law and representative institutions; the papacy and Christian community; universities, scholastic philosophy and Gothic architecture, etc.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
